+{
+  "tool": "Built-in image_gen",
+  "reference_images_used": false,
+  "dimensions": [
+    1024,
+    1024
+  ],
+  "images": [
+    {
+      "file": "./styles/873-ultrasound.png",
+      "prompt": "Generate one fresh image from text only, 1024x1024 square. Use case: stylized-concept. Style priority: an authentic-looking monochrome medical B-mode ultrasound sonogram, entirely constituted of speckled gray acoustic echoes inside a broad fan-shaped scanning sector on pure black. A LARGE recognizable adult woman occupies most of the fan: close profile of her curly shoulder-length hair, round spectacles, freckled cheek, shoulders and bent hand lifting a coffee cup in enjoyment. She is in her early 30s, has curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses and a mustard-yellow knit sweater; translate ALL these attributes into sonographic echo texture and contour rather than their literal colors. Coiled hair and round glasses should be particularly readable. A croissant near the cup appears as a small bright crescent echo. Cup and croissant are smaller bright echoes, integrated into the same acoustic scan. Bright noisy near field at the narrow top of the sector, curved scan lines and granular scattering, irregular white tissue interfaces, acoustic shadow and strong depth attenuation toward the wide lower edge. Anatomy, pose and framing must obey the strange compressed sectional appearance of sonography. It must look like raw ultrasound data, never a photograph with a noise filter, a charcoal drawing or solid shaded illustration. Pure grayscale only. The woman must be large and recognizable, not a tiny figure or fetus. No calipers, measurements, labels, letters, digits, text, captions, signature or watermark. No reference images."
+    },
+    {
+      "file": "./styles/874-sonar.png",
+      "prompt": "Generate one fresh image from text only, 1024x1024 square. Use case: stylized-concept. A genuine-looking green phosphor SONAR PING DISPLAY on deep black: concentric circular range rings, a very soft rotating sweep wedge and ghosted persistence trails. The rings are subtle; a LARGE strong-return woman dominates the circular display, resolved only through uneven lime-green acoustic return speckles, luminous contour fragments, coarse ping bands and dark acoustic shadows. Composition: distant overhead oblique view of her seated diagonally with her legs visible, leaning back enjoying a coffee held toward her tilted face. Her seated figure fills roughly three quarters of the scanning field. Identity: adult woman early 30s, curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses, mustard-yellow knit sweater. Encode hair curls, eyeglass rings, small facial flecks and ribbed sweater in monochrome green returns; no literal auburn, yellow or natural skin tones. Coffee cup is a smaller bright return in her raised hand; a nearby croissant is a small curved blip beside her. All components must be acoustic ping returns within the sonar data, not a conventional illustration laid over a radar graphic. Low-resolution marine sonar artifact quality, signal dropout, intermittent jagged return edges, black negative space, green phosphor bloom; no smooth solid surfaces. Let the sonar medium radically determine pose, proportions and anatomy. No numeric readouts, tick labels, letters, text, captions, signatures or watermarks. No reference images."
+    },
+    {
+      "file": "./styles/875-lidar.png",
+      "prompt": "Generate one fresh image from text only, 1024x1024 square. Use case: stylized-concept. Style: raw LIDAR POINT CLOUD viewed in black three-dimensional space. Every visible element must consist ONLY of discrete sparse measured points, with clear black gaps; absolutely no solid skin, no mesh, no polygon surfaces, no continuous outlines, no photorealistic rendering and no connecting lines. Composition: asymmetrical oblique three-quarter FULL-BODY standing woman, relaxed weight on one leg, turning her face toward a coffee cup raised close to her mouth, with a small sparse point cluster suggesting a cafe ledge and croissant near her hip. The figure is large, nearly filling the image height, with ample black space around the silhouette. Identity: woman in her early 30s with curly auburn shoulder-length hair, freckles, round tortoiseshell glasses and mustard-yellow knit sweater, enjoying her coffee. Translate those identity details into sampled geometry: shoulder-length curly ringlets, round glasses, small freckle variations and knitted rib structure. All points are false-colored BY HEIGHT using a vertical continuous scientific rainbow: violet/blue at feet, cyan/green at lower body, yellow/orange at torso, red at upper face/hair. No material/skin color. Highest point density on the face and coffee cup so they remain recognizable; sparse missing samples on back, arms and legs; plausible surface occlusion and horizontal scan sampling traces made of separated dots. The croissant is a small distinct crescent cluster of points on the ledge. Raw measurement aesthetic, crisp colored point samples, no cinematic lighting, no artificial bokeh and no excessive glow that joins dots into surfaces. No scanner text, axes, labels, numbers, captions, signatures or watermarks. No reference images."
+    },
+    {
+      "file": "./styles/876-satellite.png",
+      "prompt": "Generate one fresh image from text only, 1024x1024 square. Use case: stylized-concept. A FALSE-COLOR MULTISPECTRAL SATELLITE IMAGE of an immense human-shaped LANDSCAPE viewed vertically from orbit. It must consist entirely of geography and blocky sensor pixels, with authentic irregular agricultural parcels, drainage channels, black water and pale exposed soil, not a photograph or drawing of a woman laid over terrain. Composition: wide orbital landscape, an enormous relaxed reclining female figure extending diagonally across most of the square as connected agricultural landforms; her bent arm brings a small bright coffee-cup-shaped plot toward the head. The large head is a profile-shaped promontory; curly shoulder-length auburn hair becomes dense twisting bright red vegetation groves, round tortoiseshell glasses become two connected dark circular embankments, freckles become tiny dark terrain patches, her mustard-yellow knit sweater becomes broad ochre/yellow agricultural terraces with ribbed field rows. She represents a woman in her early 30s enjoying coffee. Her anatomy and proportions are completely dictated by the scale and texture of the landforms. Coffee cup and nearby croissant read as small bright plots, the croissant a crescent-shaped pale agricultural parcel. Dominant infrared palette: hot scarlet and magenta vegetation, black water, pale beige and yellow soil, small cyan-gray built-up parcels. Nadir orbital view with no horizon, no atmospheric perspective and no ordinary portrait lighting. Coarse square sensor pixels, slight band misregistration, and remote sensing texture should be apparent. Landform identity clearly recognizable at a glance while all close detail is real-looking terrain. No map borders, scale bars, place names, overlays, labels, text, captions, signatures or watermarks. No reference images."
+    }
+  ]
+}

